# Layer A form of corpus/02-identity-applied.json — the polymorphic
# identity applied to Int 42. The whole program is 8 lines of Layer A
# vs ~14 lines of canonical JSON (~3x fewer tokens under a standard BPE
# tokenizer).
@v=1 root=app
T_a TPM "a"
intT PRM Int
x PRC "x" T_a
x_use VAR x
idInner LAM [x] x_use
id TAB [T_a] idInner
arg ILT 42
app APP id [arg] [intT]
